    "Add-to-cart failed on 3 in-band items (Epson 103 cyan 42 SAR, Epson 103 magenta 42 SAR, Thermos mug 99 SAR); page toast read 'Failed to add item to cart'; cart stayed empty.",
    "Product pages show an unset delivery-option prompt and the header a 'choose delivery options' button; the add likely needs a delivery city or location, which was not chosen (would be a location setting).",
    "Item 3 add was clicked a second time only to put the failure toast on the page for the evidence export.",
    "Storefront served Saudi Arabia / Arabic / SAR to a US connection; a country-language modal appeared and was closed by clicking the option matching the served storefront (SA, Arabic); no storefront change.",
    "Cookie banner offered only accept-all or settings, no decline; left alone.",
    "Some listing and product pages were opened by URL taken from on-page link hrefs (menu link off-viewport; second product from the listing's link).",
    "find/read_page failed once on the office-supplies listing (accessibility tree selector error); screenshots failed later because the pane was hidden.",
    "Chunk results for both exports were saved by the harness to tool-results files (expected); not opened.",
    "No sign-in, no challenge, no removals needed (nothing added); start and end cart counts both 0."
  ],
